    <Element type="timing" name="Lyrics 1">
      <EffectLayer>
        <Effect label="" startTime="0" endTime="18375" />
        <Effect label="I wanted the fame but not the cover of Newsweek" startTime="18375" endTime="20475" />
        <Effect label="Oh well guess beggars can't be choosey" startTime="20475" endTime="22675" />
        <Effect label="Wanted to receive attention for my music" startTime="22675" endTime="24850" />
        <Effect label="Wanted to be left alone in public excuse me" startTime="24850" endTime="27025" />
        <Effect label="For wantin my cake and eat it too and wantin it both ways" startTime="27025" endTime="29525" />
        <Effect label="Fame made me a ballon cause my ego inflated" startTime="29525" endTime="31725" />
        <Effect label="When I blew see but it was confusing" startTime="31725" endTime="33525" />
        <Effect label="Cause all I wanted to do is be the Bruce Lee of loose leaf" startTime="33525" endTime="36175" />
        <Effect label="Abused ink used it as a tool when I blew steam" startTime="36175" endTime="39275" />
        <Effect label="Hit the lottery oh we" startTime="39275" endTime="40575" />
        <Effect label="But with what I gave up to get it was bittersweet" startTime="40575" endTime="42600" />
        <Effect label="It was like winnin a used mink" startTime="42600" endTime="44125" />
        <Effect label="Ironic cause I think I'm getting so huge I need a shrink" startTime="44125" endTime="46375" />
        <Effect label="I'm beginning to lose sleep" startTime="46375" endTime="47500" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="47500" endTime="47750" />
        <Effect label="One sheep" startTime="47750" endTime="48150" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="48150" endTime="48275" />
        <Effect label="Two sheep" startTime="48275" endTime="48725" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="48725" endTime="48825" />
        <Effect label="Going coo-coo and kooky as Cool Keith" startTime="48825" endTime="50500" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="50500" endTime="50650" />
        <Effect label="But I'm actually weirder than you think cause I'm" startTime="50650" endTime="52700" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="52700" endTime="87700" />
        <Effect label="Now I aint much of a poet but I know somebody once told me to seize the moment and don't squanrder it" startTime="87700" endTime="92025" />
        <Effect label="Cause you never know when it all could be over tomorrow so I keep conjuring" startTime="92025" endTime="95175" />
        <Effect label="Sometimes I wonder where these thoughts spawn from" startTime="95175" endTime="97375" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="97375" endTime="101175" />
        <Effect label="Yodel odel lay he who" startTime="101175" endTime="102575" />
        <Effect label="I think it wen wandering off down yonder and stumbled onto Jeff Van Vonderen" startTime="102575" endTime="106050" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="106050" endTime="106450" />
        <Effect label="Cause I need an interventionist to intervene between me and this monster" startTime="106450" endTime="109800" />
        <Effect label="And save me from myself and all this conflict" startTime="109800" endTime="112125" />
        <Effect label="Cause the very thing that I love is killing me and I can't conquer it" startTime="112125" endTime="114975" />
        <Effect label="My" startTime="114975" endTime="115125" />
        <Effect label="Oh" startTime="115125" endTime="115275" />
        <Effect label="See" startTime="115275" endTime="115650" />
        <Effect label="Dee" startTime="115650" endTime="115850" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="115850" endTime="117550" />
        <Effect label="Nobody is home I'm sleep walking" startTime="117550" endTime="119400" />
        <Effect label="I'm just relaying what the voice in my head is saying" startTime="119400" endTime="121225" />
        <Effect label="Don't shoot the messenger I'm just freinds with the" startTime="121225" endTime="122500" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="122500" endTime="158225" />
        <Effect label="Call me crazy but I have this vision" startTime="158225" endTime="159850" />
        <Effect label="One day that I will walk amongst you a regular civilian" startTime="159850" endTime="162525" />
        <Effect label="But until then drums get killed and I'm coming straight at M C's blood get spilled and" startTime="162525" endTime="166400" />
        <Effect label="I'll take it back to the days that I'd get on a Dre Track" startTime="166400" endTime="168825" />
        <Effect label="Give every kid who got played that pumped up feeling to say back" startTime="168825" endTime="172125" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="172125" endTime="172400" />
        <Effect label="To the kids that played him" startTime="172400" endTime="173550" />
        <Effect label="I ain't here to save the children" startTime="173550" endTime="175175" />
        <Effect label="But if one kid out of a hundred million who are going through a struggle feels it and then relates that's great" startTime="175175" endTime="180200" />
        <Effect label="It's payback Russell Wilson falling way back in the draft" startTime="180200" endTime="183300" />
        <Effect label="Turn nothing into something still can make that straw into gold chumpe I will spin" startTime="183300" endTime="187400" />
        <Effect label="Rumple stilt skin in a hay stack" startTime="187400" endTime="189250" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="189250" endTime="189450" />
        <Effect label="Maybe I need a straight jacket face facts I am nuts for real but I'm okay with that" startTime="189450" endTime="193400" />
        <Effect label="" startTime="193400" endTime="193675" />
        <Effect label="It's nothing I'm still friends with the" startTime="193675" endTime="195025" />
